{"ref":"BDB, צָהַל","hw":"צָהַל","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צָהַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. neigh, cry shrilly (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">صَهَلَ</span> <em>neigh</em>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܨܗܰܠ</span> id.<em>;</em> 𝔗 <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:15\" href=\"/Esther.8.15\">Est 8:15</a> = BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָֽהֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:15\" href=\"/Esther.8.15\">Est 8:15</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָֽהֲלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.14\">Is 24:14</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצְהָ֑לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.8\">Je 5:8</a>; 2 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תצהלי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.11\">50:11</a> Kt, Qr 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּצְהֲלוּ</span> and so Vrss; Imv. fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַהֲלִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.30\">Is 10:30</a> +; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַהֲלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.7\">Je 31:7</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>neigh</em>, of men under fig. of stallions; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <em>unto</em> (in desire) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.8\">Je 5:8</a>, of profligate Judaeans; abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.11\">50:11</a> of arrogant Chaldeans. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>cry shrilly</em>, in distress <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.30\">Is 10:30</a> (c. adv. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹלֵךְ</span>); usually joy, praise (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רָנַן</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.6\">12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.1\">54:1</a>, c. ב <em>at, over</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.7\">Je 31:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.14\">Is 24:14</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂמֵ֑חָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:15\" href=\"/Esther.8.15\">Est 8:15</a>.","next":"BDB, מִ